            radio_selected_foreground.png for selected_idle_. Note two
            traps it exists to document: counting lit pixels cannot see this
            (swapping the selection is pixel-count symmetric, so it hashes),
            and every whole-stage check still passes with the foreground
            draw removed, on the label colour alone -- which is why the
