  playtest  the preferences "Test" button, driven through the focus list so
            the screen, config.sample_sound and the Play() action all have to
            agree. Also the channel mapping and the loop defaults for
            Play/Stop. The sound half is checked with no pump at all: the host
            shim consumes every buffer instantly, so a short non-looping
            effect is over within a few polls and the channel reads idle
            again -- the music half survives its pump only because it loops.
            Takes the pak and the game dir
  juketest  the jukebox: MusicRoom built by real init-python code, clicking a
